Makes Dracula seem
less impossible, l guess.

198
00:14:01,758 --> 00:14:03,300
Werewolves don't grow wolf hair.

199
00:14:03,468 --> 00:14:04,718
-That's just a myth.
-Yeah.

200
00:14:04,886 --> 00:14:10,098
So what, we've got a vampire and
a werewolf monster-mashing this town?

201
00:14:11,559 --> 00:14:14,102
