Well, beers are on me.

206
00:14:22,737 --> 00:14:25,572
And just so you know,
I get off at midnight tonight.

207
00:14:26,616 --> 00:14:29,076
Oh, it's not another girls' night out?

208
00:14:29,244 --> 00:14:30,327
Doesn't have to be.

209
00:14:31,496 --> 00:14:33,705
-Okay then. I'll see you tonight.
-Okay then.

210
00:14:40,797 --> 00:14:44,091
Hey, you think this Dracula
could turn into a bat?

211
00:14:45,176 --> 00:14:47,135
That'd be cool.

212
