222
00:15:29,762 --> 00:15:31,346
There's no nothing.

223
00:15:31,514 --> 00:15:33,348
I don't know when it was delivered.

224
00:15:33,516 --> 00:15:38,020
It was here when I clocked in tonight.
I thought you'd know what to do.

225
00:15:38,187 --> 00:15:40,022
Think Helen has
any record of it in her files?

226
00:15:40,189 --> 00:15:42,441
[SCRAPING THEN A SOFT THUD]

227
00:15:58,166 --> 00:16:02,169
Holy mother of crap! Aah.
Aah!

228
00:16:06,549 --> 00:16:09,593
No! No! Aah!

229
00:16:09,802 --> 00:16:12,763
Aah! No!

230
00:16:13,014 --> 00:16:15,515
[GASPlNG, CHOKlNG]

231
