236
00:16:39,916 --> 00:16:42,167
COP 1 :
Go get your photos right here.

237
00:16:42,335 --> 00:16:45,671
DElTRICH: l want a statement from
everybody about the delivery guy.

238
00:16:45,838 --> 00:16:49,174
COP 1 : You wanna try that?
COP 2: Be a good idea.

239
00:16:50,968 --> 00:16:52,052
[SCOFFS]

240
00:16:52,220 --> 00:16:54,513
This sarcophagus isn't ancient.

241
00:16:54,681 --> 00:16:56,890
It's from a prop house in Philly.

242
00:16:59,185 --> 00:17:00,811
Oh.

243
00:17:01,187 --> 00:17:05,732
